      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "markdown_ar": "استمع إلى طالب يحكي عن **عطلة نهاية الأسبوع** في قرية جده قرب **تعز**. انتبه للأفعال المنتهية بـ **-ed**."
        },
        {
          "type": "audio",
          "text_en": "Last weekend was great. On Thursday afternoon, my family and I travelled to my grandfather's village near Taiz. The trip was three hours long. We arrived in the evening and my grandparents were very happy. On Friday morning, my cousins and I climbed the mountain behind the village. The weather was cool and sunny. We walked for two hours and we watched the green fields from the top. After the Friday prayer, my grandmother cooked lunch for everybody. It was delicious. In the evening, we talked and listened to my grandfather's old stories. We returned home on Saturday. I was tired, but I was very happy."
        },
